clock=0;sections=[]
md=['# AegisPay — eight-slide pitch source','','**Refreshed 9 November 2026.** Presenter: Salvador Vincent Javier, solo builder. Current-state Testnet pitch: integration proof, deployed recorded-proof viewer, local foundations and an unresolved application attempt. Full autonomous purchasing, recovery and hosted release remain unfinished. The supplied Nov 8 organizer email names AegisPay Top 15; finals date and venue remain TBA. Handbook working format: five-minute pitch + three-minute Q&A; rubric 30/25/20/15/10 (agentic fit / technical execution / innovation / real-world potential / pitch).','',f'Fixed destinations: [website]({site}), [submitted PDF]({pdf}), [source]({repo}), [recovered video folder]({folder}). The folder does not establish a newly uploaded or playable MP4.','','The HTML is the visual source with identical timed notes. Notes, controls and Q&A are excluded from print. Local refresh awaits coordinator review/publication at the existing path.','']
for i,s in enumerate(slides,1):
 start=f'{clock//60}:{clock%60:02}';clock+=s['seconds'];end=f'{clock//60}:{clock%60:02}'
 sections.append(f'<section class="slide{" dark" if s["dark"] else ""}" aria-labelledby="s{i}"><div class="eyebrow"><span>{s["kicker"]}</span><span class="badge">{s["badge"]}</span></div>{s["body"]}<footer class="footer"><span class="sources">{s["sources"]}</span><span class="num">{i:02} / 08</span></footer><aside class="notes" data-seconds="{s["seconds"]}"><h3>{start}–{end} · {s["seconds"]} seconds</h3><p>{s["notes"]}</p></aside></section>')
 md += [f'## Slide {i} — {s["title"]}','',f'**{start}–{end} · {s["seconds"]} seconds.** {s["badge"]}.','',s['notes'],'','**On-screen content:** '+s['title']+' See [deck.html](deck.html) for exact diagrams, receipt, labels and clickable evidence.','']
qa='''<p><strong>Did Gemini buy QuickSignal?</strong> No. Nov 7 is a headless agent-key authorization. Gemini separately completed a harmless tool round trip. The Nov 9 application attempt is unknown and unentitled.</p><p><strong>What is built?</strong> Deployed recorded-proof viewer; local workspaces, PostgreSQL quote/budget/nonce/evidence foundation, private auth/wallet APIs, worker source and Gemini adapter. TASK-005 is not done. Full model/report/recovery/release gates remain open.</p><p><strong>What do tests prove?</strong> Backend report records 64 PostgreSQL, 73 unit and 50 offline spike passes, with synthetic chain/provider transport. Historical live proof and actual public UI/deployment browser evidence are separate.</p><p><strong>Unresolved identity?</strong> Quote 2919ccca-2d31-4bc4-9140-649c8b1fc0ae; attempt f69178b7-0b0b-46fa-8e82-65c2dd5deee5; inner 36f71d7ddee16271b6c23e73fa5ef1f1ca4f0e44e3d0a52ef6eca2115f80d0f8. One handoff, held 300000, spent 0, entitlement 0. Provider status claimed is not merchant claim or verified success.</p><p><strong>Why not retry?</strong> Observe the original identity, no re-sign or redispatch. A conservative marker may stall before network send; at-most-once handoff is not universal exactly-once execution. Backend work stopped at Orca retry breaker after quota/startup failures; no replacement financial call is authorized.</p><p><strong>Enforced where?</strong> Noir: per-payment cap, expiry and finite escrow. App: task budget and owner/quote/resource binding. Event alone omits asset/agent. Content quality and fair exchange are not guaranteed. A stolen authorized key may attempt repeated individually permitted payments until escrow/expiry/revocation limits it.</p><p><strong>What is merchant claim?</strong> Separate signed collection of pending escrow; neither a second purchase nor Velo status claimed.</p><p><strong>How different?</strong> Narrow Noir/Velo composition, evidence mapping and intended dependable resource workflow. No moat, mainnet, audit, zero-knowledge or x402 conformance claim. HTTP 402-inspired proprietary adapter. Prepaid keys and existing payment products remain credible alternatives.</p><p><strong>Why Gas?</strong> Actual Velo sponsorship/submission/status for the same Noir invocation. Organizer-specific acceptance is not independently confirmed; Top 15 selection is not a technical ruling.</p><p><strong>Finals / media?</strong> Supplied Nov 8 email says Top 15, date/venue TBA. Handbook working format is five-minute pitch + three-minute Q&A. Drive link is a folder; new MP4 upload/playback is unverified.</p>'''
html='<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="AegisPay: useful data, bounded authority. Current-state Testnet pitch, 9 November 2026."><title>AegisPay — finals pitch · 9 November 2026</title><style>'+css+'</style></head><body><nav class="toolbar" aria-label="Presentation controls"><span><b>AegisPay</b> · 8 slides · 5-minute pitch + 3-minute Q&amp;A</span><div><button id="notes-toggle">Speaker notes (N)</button> <button id="qa-toggle">Q&amp;A prompts</button> <button onclick="window.print()">Print / PDF</button></div></nav><main>'+''.join(sections)+'</main><aside id="qa" class="qa" hidden aria-label="Three-minute Q and A prompts"><button id="qa-close">Close</button><h2>Three-minute Q&amp;A · presenter prompts</h2>'+qa+'</aside><script>'+script+'</script></body></html>'
Path('docs/submission/deck.html').write_text(html,encoding='utf-8')
md += ['## Three-minute Q&A','','Owner: Salvador Vincent Javier. The HTML Q&A panel contains the full current answer map and is excluded from PDF.','', '- Successful Nov 7 proof was headless, not a model report purchase. Inner/outer identify one payment; merchant claim is separate.','- Nov 9 attempt remains unknown: quote `2919ccca-2d31-4bc4-9140-649c8b1fc0ae`, attempt `f69178b7-0b0b-46fa-8e82-65c2dd5deee5`, inner `36f71d7ddee16271b6c23e73fa5ef1f1ca4f0e44e3d0a52ef6eca2115f80d0f8`. Held 300000, spent 0, no entitlement. Last saved Velo status HTTP 409, prior RPC NOT_FOUND. Provider status claimed is not merchant claim.','- Backend report records 64 PostgreSQL / 73 unit / 50 offline spike passes with synthetic chain/provider transport. These are attributed reports, not deck-worker reruns or live acceptance.','- Noir policy/expiry/finite escrow and app task budget/resource binding are separate. Unknown stays unentitled; observe original identity. No universal exactly-once claim.','- Backend stopped at Orca retry breaker after quota/startup failures; no replacement task or financial call authorized. Full model purchase/recovery/release open.','- No customers, partners, revenue, validated economics, market-size, mainnet, audit, zero-knowledge or x402 conformance claim. Gas is the actual Velo role; organizer-specific acceptance not independently confirmed.','- Top 15 per supplied Nov 8 email; finals date/venue TBA. Video destination is a folder; new MP4 upload/playback unverified.','',f'**Notes duration: {clock} seconds.** [Rendering](deck-rendering.md) · [TASK-016 evidence](../evidence/finals-pitch-refresh/task-016.md).']
Path('docs/submission/pitch-deck.md').write_text('\n'.join(md)+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
